                "raw": "<b>The Apothecary is equipped with: </b>bolt pistol; Astartes chainsword. <br><br><b>The Company Ancient is equipped with:</b> bolt pistol; close combat weapon. <br><br><b>The Company Champion is equipped with:</b> bolt pistol; Champion’s blade; Astartes shield. <br><br><b>Each Company Veteran is equipped with:</b> bolt pistol; boltgun, close combat weapon.",
